do_2 = "Replace brand assets (logos, icons, splash, favicons, app names, desktop appId and product name, mobile app name and bundle identifiers) with Hyperfide equivalents generated from the repository's existing VS Code extension icon where no asset exists; record the asset provenance in platform/assets/README.md."
do_3 = "0_6.sh runs the identity rules of the rename map in --dry-run over the touched files and asserts zero remaining matches, and asserts the desktop and mobile manifests parse and carry Hyperfide names."
